comments.body:
@julianoes Unfortunately, we don't exactly know what error was prompted. I created branch https://github.com/dronecore/DroneCore/compare/verify-multi-mission for testing this.

@dangviethieu-hntv Could you please provide console logs of the example you run ?
>And how do device stop mission?

I think even in QGC, you can only change Mission mode to some other mode for stopping a mission.
So, you may call `action->land()` that stops executing current mission item and does mode switch to `AUTO.LAND`.
As I understand your query, you want to fly different missions one after the other. Could you please try testing https://github.com/dronecore/DroneCore/commit/5aec81f36eef551f42c4d64b5c24598eb389dae3 ?

